/zenodo.23605698", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23605699", "metadata": {"title": "Replication Package for MSR Technical Paper #381", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23605699", "publication_date": "2026-10-24", "description": "<p>This is a replication package for the paper. Please read README.md to use it.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Anonymous, Anonymous", "affiliation": null}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23605698"}}]}}, "title": "Replication Package for MSR Technical Paper #381", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23605699", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23605699?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23605699", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23605699", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23605699", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605698", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23605698", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23605698", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23605698", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23605699/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23605699/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23605699/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-24T06:24:35.103966+00:00", "recid": "23605699", "revision": 6, "files": [{"id": "8633c5bc-a988-40f0-8f88-13aca84df45f", "key": "Replication-Package-Do-AI-Agents-Bypass-the-Type-Chcker-More-Than-Humans.zip", "size": 702941605, "checksum": "md5:48ad5d4913e2a6ad8c40bd387412e464", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/files/Replication-Package-Do-AI-Agents-Bypass-the-Type-Chcker-More-Than-Humans.zip/content"}}, {"id": "a3b18ca4-ac05-446d-be05-57db61e56367", "key": "README.md", "size": 21965, "checksum": "md5:e452162daa2e42b2184e5c9f21d05779", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23605699/files/README.md/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1601953"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 0, "unique_downloads": 0, "views": 9, "unique_views": 5, "version_downloads": 0, "version_unique_downloads": 0, "version_unique_views": 5, "version_views": 9}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-10-24T04:27:44.670920+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-24T04:27:44.838211+00:00", "id": 23609446, "conceptrecid": "23555044", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23609446", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23555044", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23609446", "metadata": {"title": "Replication package for \"Festival Timing Effects in Prices and Production: Why Is Indian Diwali Not the Same as the Chinese New Year?\"", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23609446", "publication_date": "2026-10-24", "description": "<p>Replication package for &ldquo;Festival Timing Effects in Prices and Production: Why Is Indian Diwali Not the Same as the Chinese New Year?&rdquo; (Vidushi Balakrishnan, Isaac Centre for Public Policy, Ashoka University).</p>\n<p>The package reproduces the estimates, tables, figures and supplementary material of the paper. The paper estimates the Diwali moving-holiday effect in the All-India Consumer Price Index (2012 base) and the Index of Industrial Production (2011-12 base), and the Chinese New Year effect in the Chinese consumer price index, within X-13ARIMA-SEATS seasonal adjustment models.</p>\n<p>Contents:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>paper/: the manuscript, the supplementary material, the figures, and RESULTS_LEDGER.md, which traces every number in the paper to its result file.</li>\n<li>code/: the Python and R scripts and their result files. code/README.md maps each script to the tables, figures and supplement sections it produces.</li>\n<li>data/: the input data, which are official statistics from MoSPI (India), the National Bureau of Statistics of China and the OECD (via FRED), plus intermediate results of the author&rsquo;s R analysis. data/R_inputs/ holds the inputs of the R scripts under the file names they expect.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The licensed Haver Analytics extract is not included. The README lists its series codes (N924PCP; J534DB, J534DK, J534DI, J534DR, J534DCD, J534DCN, J534D) and the agency releases that publish the same figures.</p>\n<p>Requirements: Python 3.10+ (numpy, pandas, scipy, matplotlib); the US Census Bureau X-13ARIMA-SEATS program, build 1.1.61; R 4.x with the seasonal package (and readxl for D1a.R). Code is released under the MIT License. The data are redistributed for replication only, under the terms of the original sources.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Balakrishnan, Vidushi", "affiliation": "Ashoka University"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://ssrn.com/abstract=7337538", "relation": "cites", "resource_type": "publication", "scheme": "url"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23555044"}}]}}, "title": "Replication package for \"Festival Timing Effects in Prices and Production: Why Is Indian Diwali Not the Same as the Chinese New Year?\"", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23609446", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23609446", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23609446?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23609446", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23609446", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23609446", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23609446/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23555044", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23555044", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23555044", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23555044", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23609446/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23609446/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23609446/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23609446/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23609446/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23609446/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23609446/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23609446/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23609446/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23609446/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23609446/access/users", "acc